						<p data-gone style="opacity: 0; animation: pvo-txt-2 5.4s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .6, 1) 0s both;">No signal, it opens from there.</p>
						<p style="animation: pvo-txt-3 5.4s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .6, 1) 0s both;">Back up, it catches up on its own.</p>
					</div>
					<p class="st-hg-body">Timetable, rooms and courses stay on the phone, and a room that changed is updated as soon as the signal returns.</p>
				</div>
				<div slot="media-2" class="pv-stage-box" aria-hidden="true">
					<div class="st-hg-anim pv-stage" style="position: relative; width: 452px; height: 472px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
					        <div style="width: 360px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">

