					                  <span style="flex-grow: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px;"><b style="font-size: 13px; white-space: nowrap;">Ingegneria del Software</b><span style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10.5px; color: #5e5a53;">2026-27, Sez. A</span></span>
