					                      <span style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;">
					                        <span style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c9c5bc;">Prossima lezione</span>
